        "Description": "Several years ago, current Turkish head of state, Jonathan Ripples, fell unconscious after eating a tub of strawberry ice cream and was later discovered being bounced on by several young schoolchildren.  The man responsible for this was Martin Launderette, the owner of the launderette in Lamonic Bibber. He has now fled Lamonic Bibber and is residing in a luxury hotel resort in Bangkok and now goes by the psuedonym Alexander Hoffman. It is your job to hunt him down and seek revenge\r\rGood Luck",
